					<paragraph lineSpacing="1_1_2"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["<br />We accept VISA, Mastercard, Discover and electronic check. For phone payments, please call us at  (505) 662-8333. or pay online at <u><font color='blue'><a href='https://www.losalamosnm.us/Services/Make-a-Payment' target='_blank'>https://www.losalamosnm.us/Services/Make-a-Payment</a></font></u> and select Pay Utility Bill.<br /><br />"+

